9,0,1,talk,Shion,,I'll be watching all of you. Try not to be too obvious.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, why are you being so quiet? Are you the wolf?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Rin, jumping to conclusions based on silence is not rational.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Let's not start accusations yet. We have no information.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I am simply observing the flow of the conversation.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,It's interesting how Rin immediately targets the quietest person.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'm just curious! That's how you find the bad guys!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Curiosity is fine, but we need a strategy for the coming days.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
