32,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? I'm still ready to hunt!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Your enthusiasm is consistent, Rin. Almost too consistent.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I have information. Rin, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Toshio,,That was a very direct claim for the first day.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, are you claiming to be the Seer? That's a bold move.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,What?! No way! Mizuki is lying! I'm just a kid!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Mizuki is the Seer, the game could end today. But is she?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I am the Seer. I divined Rin last night, and the result was werewolf.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Mizuki is lying, she's either the wolf or the possessed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,Or she's a villager trying to force a vote. But the timing is precise.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not the wolf! Please believe me! Mizuki is mean!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"Rin's reaction is emotional, which is expected, but not proof.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,My result is absolute. There is no reason for me to lie.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we execute Rin and she's human, we lose a valuable member.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"However, if we don't, and she is the wolf, we lose someone tonight.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll cry! You're all being mean to me!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will trust the logic of the Seer's claim for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I stand by my divination. Vote for Rin.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The risk of keeping a werewolf is higher than the risk of a fake Seer.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'm convinced. Let's see if Mizuki is telling the truth.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
